WEBVTT

1
00:00:33.918 --> 00:00:55.906
A Deployable environment holds schemas and no records

2
00:00:55.906 --> 00:01:12.606
Loaded means Storage accepted the records, not that search finds them

3
00:01:12.606 --> 00:01:32.770
Ingestion writes on behalf of whoever started it

4
00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:51.814
Example: spi test dags, as me

5
00:01:51.814 --> 00:02:17.370
Easy mistake: It's Deployable, so the data is there.

